    "This is especially dangerous against an opponent with only two Life, but it can also force them to spend many Counter cards.",
    "**Option 2: A second OP18-027 Zoro & Sogeking.** If your opponent still has a lot of Life or defensive resources, playing a second Zoro & Sogeking may be better.",
