  ]},
  { cards: [zoro], title: "OP16-035 Roronoa Zoro — Mid-Cost Flexibility", paragraphs: [
    "Roronoa Zoro is a useful card for improving your 7- and 8-DON!! turns, where the deck has few attractive options.",
