    "Keeping 1 DON!! Active can let you use Demon Aura Nine Sword Style Asura Blades Drawn Dead Man's Game during your opponent's turn.",
    "With Nico Robin, you can get 1 DON!! Active at the end of your turn to prepare that defense.",
    "When you are trying to finish the game, however, keeping too much DON!! available can unnecessarily weaken your attacks.",
    "The distinction is important: to survive, keep the resources you need for Counter Events; to finish the game, prioritize attack Power if the additional DON!! really increases your chances of lethal.",
    "Do not give up several thousand Power on offense to keep DON!! you probably will not use."
  ]},
  { cards: [leader], paragraphs: [
    "Monkey.D.Luffy can deal enormous damage in a single turn, but a failed offensive can leave you without defensive resources.",
    "Before committing, check for Blockers, your opponent's Active DON!!, possible Triggers, and the Counters they may still have.",
    "Also consider your own hand. The deck can quickly run low on cards while some opponents may have more than ten cards in hand.",
    "If you cannot reasonably survive the next turn, a risky offensive may be your best option. If you still have a solid defense, developing your board or removing a threat may offer better prospects.",
    "The most important thing is knowing when to maintain pressure, when to preserve resources, and when to commit all your attacks to finish the game."
  ]}
];

const renderText = (text) => text.split(/(\*\*.*?\*\*)/g);
---

<MainLayout title={title} description={description}>
  <section class="hero guide-hero"><div class="container hero-grid"><div class="hero-copy"><div class="hero-tags"><span class="hero-chip">Deck Guide</span><span class="hero-chip hero-chip-accent">OP18 Format</span></div><h1>Monkey D. Luffy OP18 Deck Guide</h1><p class="hero-intro">Your priority is to find OP18-031 Nico Robin while keeping a hand that can develop your board and prepare your first offensive turns.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="#curve">Game Plan &amp; Curve</a><a class="btn btn-secondary" href="#matchups">Matchups</a><a class="btn btn-secondary btn-card-list" href="/cards-list/OP18/">Card List OP18</a></div></div><div class="guide-icon"><img src={guideIcon} alt="Monkey D. Luffy OP18 deck guide icon" loading="eager" /></div></div></section>
  <div class="container article-stack">
    <section id="decklist" class="glow-block"><div class="decklist-title-row"><h2>Decklist</h2><button class="btn btn-primary copy-sim-button" type="button" data-copy-sim={simDeckCode}>Copy for Sim</button></div><div class="deck-grid">{decklist.map((entry) => <button class="deck-card" type="button" data-card-preview data-full={entry.img} data-name={`${entry.code} ${entry.name}`}><img src={getCardThumbnail(entry.img)} alt={`${entry.code} ${entry.name}`} loading="lazy"/><div class="deck-info"><b class="deck-count">{entry.count}x</b><span>{entry.name}<small class="deck-code">{entry.code}</small><small class="deck-role">{entry.role}</small></span></div></button>)}</div></section>
    <section id="mulligan" class="glow-block"><h2>Mulligan</h2>{mulliganIntro.map((text) => <p>{text}</p>)}<div class="content-list">{mulligan.map((item) => <article class={`content-item has-cards ${item.cards.length > 1 ? "multiple-cards" : ""} ${item.titleAboveCards ? "title-above-cards" : ""} ${item.textBesideCards ? "text-beside-cards" : ""}`}><h3>{item.title}</h3><div class="card-row">{item.cards.map((entry) => <button class="mini-card" type="button" data-card-preview data-full={entry.img} data-name={`${entry.code} ${entry.name}`}><img src={getCardThumbnail(entry.img)} alt={`${entry.code} ${entry.name}`} loading="lazy"/></button>)}</div><div class="paragraphs">{item.paragraphs.map((text) => <p>{renderText(text).map((part) => part.startsWith("**") && part.endsWith("**") ? <strong>{part.slice(2,-2)}</strong> : part)}</p>)}</div></article>)}</div></section>
    <section id="curve" class="glow-block"><h2>Game Plan &amp; Curve</h2><p>OP18-022 Monkey.D.Luffy's game plan is built around two key cards: OP18-031 Nico Robin, which can set your Leader Active at the end of your turn, and OP18-027 Zoro &amp; Sogeking, which supports its multiple attacks while strengthening your defense.</p><p>Going second is especially effective thanks to the sequence of Robin at 4 DON!! followed by Zoro &amp; Sogeking at 6 DON!!. Going first, OP16-035 Roronoa Zoro and OP18-118 Monkey.D.Luffy offer options at odd DON!! thresholds.</p>{[["Going First", curveFirst], ["Going Second", curveSecond]].map(([heading, curve]) => <div class="curve-block"><h3>{heading}</h3>{curve.map((item) => <article class="curve-item"><strong>{item.title}</strong><div class="curve-content"><div class={`card-set ${item.cards.length === 1 ? "one" : ""} ${item.cards.length === 2 ? "two" : ""} ${item.cards.length === 4 ? "four" : ""} ${item.cards.length === 3 ? "three" : ""} ${item.connectors?.length ? "connected" : ""} ${item.optionRows ? "option-rows" : ""}`}>{item.cards.map((entry, index) => <>{index > 0 && item.connectors?.[index - 1] && <span class={`connector ${item.optionRows && item.connectors[index - 1] === "OR" && index === 2 ? "option-break" : ""}`}>{item.connectors[index - 1]}</span>}<button class="mini-card" type="button" data-card-preview data-full={entry.img} data-name={`${entry.code} ${entry.name}`}><img src={getCardThumbnail(entry.img)} alt={`${entry.code} ${entry.name}`} loading="lazy"/></button></>)}</div><div class="curve-note">{item.paragraphs.map((text) => <p>{renderText(text).map((part) => part.startsWith("**") && part.endsWith("**") ? <strong>{part.slice(2,-2)}</strong> : part)}</p>)}</div></div></article>)}</div>)}</section>
    <section id="tech-cards" class="glow-block"><h2>Tech Cards</h2><p>These Tech Cards help compensate for the weaknesses of OP18-022 Monkey.D.Luffy, especially its re-stand restriction and lack of card draw. They also provide answers to Removal, Blockers, and opposing defenses.</p><div class="content-list">{techCards.map((item) => <article class={`tech-card ${item.cards.length > 1 ? "multiple-tech-cards" : ""}`}><div class="tech-card-images">{item.cards.map((entry) => <button class="mini-card tech-card-image" type="button" data-card-preview data-full={entry.img} data-name={`${entry.code} ${entry.name}`}><img src={getCardThumbnail(entry.img)} alt={`${entry.code} ${entry.name}`} loading="lazy"/></button>)}</div><h3>{item.title}</h3><div class="paragraphs">{item.paragraphs.map((text) => <p>{renderText(text).map((part) => part.startsWith("**") && part.endsWith("**") ? <strong>{part.slice(2,-2)}</strong> : part)}</p>)}{item.bullets && <ul>{item.bullets.map((text) => <li>{text}</li>)}</ul>}{item.after?.map((text) => <p>{text}</p>)}</div></article>)}</div></section>
    <section id="matchups" class="glow-block"><h2>Matchups</h2>{matchupIntro.map((text) => <p>{text}</p>)}<div class="content-list">{matchups.map((item) => <article class="content-item matchup-card"><div class="matchup-heading"><button class="mini-card matchup-leader-card" type="button" data-card-preview data-full={item.leader.img} data-name={`${item.leader.code} ${item.leader.name}`}><img src={getCardThumbnail(item.leader.img)} alt={`${item.leader.code} ${item.leader.name} Leader`} loading="lazy"/></button><h3>{item.title}</h3></div><div class="matchup-body">{item.intro?.map((text) => <p>{text}</p>)}<h4>Game Plan</h4><ul>{item.gamePlan.map((text) => <li>{text}</li>)}</ul>{item.after?.map((text) => <p>{text}</p>)}</div></article>)}</div></section>
    <section id="tips" class="glow-block"><h2>Tips</h2><div class="content-list">{tips.map((item) => <article class="tip-card"><div class="tip-card-images">{item.cards.map((entry) => <button class="mini-card" type="button" data-card-preview data-full={entry.img} data-name={`${entry.code} ${entry.name}`}><img src={getCardThumbnail(entry.img)} alt={`${entry.code} ${entry.name}`} loading="lazy"/></button>)}</div><div class="tip-copy">{item.paragraphs.map((text) => <p>{text}</p>)}{item.bullets && <ul>{item.bullets.map((text) => <li>{text}</li>)}</ul>}{item.after?.map((text) => <p>{text}</p>)}</div></article>)}</div></section>
  </div>
  <div class="card-modal" data-modal aria-hidden="true"><div class="card-modal-inner" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-label="Card preview"><button class="modal-close" type="button" data-close>Close</button><img src="" alt="" data-modal-image/></div></div>
</MainLayout>

<script>
  const modal = document.querySelector("[data-modal]"); const modalImage = document.querySelector("[data-modal-image]");
  const closeModal = () => { modal?.classList.remove("is-open"); modal?.setAttribute("aria-hidden", "true"); document.body.style.overflow = ""; };
  document.querySelectorAll("[data-card-preview]").forEach((button) => button.addEventListener("click", () => { if (!modal || !modalImage) return; modalImage.src = button.dataset.full || ""; modalImage.alt = button.dataset.name || "Card preview"; modal.classList.add("is-open"); modal.setAttribute("aria-hidden", "false"); document.body.style.overflow = "hidden"; }));
  document.querySelector("[data-close]")?.addEventListener("click", closeModal); modal?.addEventListener("click", (event) => { if (event.target === modal) closeModal(); });
  document.querySelector("[data-copy-sim]")?.addEventListener("click", async (event) => { const button = event.currentTarget; try { await navigator.clipboard.writeText(button.dataset.copySim); const previous = button.textContent; button.textContent = "Copied"; window.setTimeout(() => { button.textContent = previous; }, 1800); } catch { button.textContent = "Copy failed"; } });
</script>

